  "description": "In this unique experience, your mission is not only to defend yourself from the relentless attacks of your obsessive yandere but also to resist her seductive temptations.\n\nEach encounter will test not only your strategic skills but also the strength of your willpower!\n\nGet ready for a challenge that blends tension, strategy, and dangerous charm.\n\n\nGAME FEATURES:\n\n● Defend yourself from your yandere’s attacks: Use your wit and reflexes to survive her attempts to capture you.\n\n● Resist her charms: Keep control of your mind and heart as she tries to seduce you with her overwhelming presence.\n\n● Unlock new images: Each level cleared reveals a more intense, enigmatic, and seductive side of your yandere.\n\n● Strategy and resilience: Use special abilities and upgrades to stay one step ahead of her obsession.\n\n● Increasing difficulty: With each level, your yandere's attacks and temptations become harder to resist.\n\n● The final challenge: Hold out until the last encounter and prove you won't fall under her spell!\n\n\nDo you have the strength to face her obsessive love and survive unscathed?\n\nDiscover it and dive into a game where defence has never been so exciting... or so dangerous!",
